@tempo 120
@swing 0.56
@fx vinyl 0.30
@fx reverb 0.45
//@fx lowpass 0.48
@instrument lead marimba 0.5
@instrument chord pad 0.4
@instrument bass slap 0.2

// Linkin Park - Numb (lofi cover)
// Key: Ab minor | Progression: Abm - Eb - E - Db 

kick:   x . . . . . . . x . . . . . . .
snare:  . . . . x . . . . . . . x . . .
hat:    x . x . x . x . x . x . x . x .
clap:   . . . . x . . . . . . . x . . .  
perc:   . . . x . . . . . x . . . . . .

bass:   Ab2 . . . Ab2 . . . Ab2 . . . Ab2 .
        Eb2 . . . Eb2 . . . E2 . . . Db2 .
        Ab2 . . . Ab2 . . . Ab2 . . . Ab2 .
        Eb2 . . . E2 . . . Db2 . . . . .

// Main piano riff: Ab Gb E Eb Db (the iconic descending line)
lead:   Ab4 . Gb4 . E4 . Eb4 .
        Db4 . Eb4 . E4 . Gb4 .
        Ab4 . Gb4 . E4 . Eb4 .
        Db4 . . . . . . .

        Ab4 . . . Gb4 . E4 .
        Eb4 . Db4 . Eb4 . E4 .
        Gb4 . Ab4 . Gb4 . E4 .
        Eb4 . Db4 . . . . .

        Ab4 . Bb4 . Ab4 . Gb4 .
        Eb4 . Gb4 . Ab4 . Bb4 . 
        Ab4 . Gb4 . Eb4 . Db4 .
        Eb4 . . . Db4 . . .


        Gb4 . Ab4 . Gb4 . E4 .
        Eb4 . Db4 . Eb4 . Gb4 .
        Ab4 . Gb4 . E4 . Eb4 .
        Db4 . . . Ab3 . . .

chords: Abm Eb E Db
